---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
title="About Quick Chan | Procurement & Supply Chain Professional"
description="Learn more about Quick Chan, MCIPS qualified procurement professional and founder of HYWSource."
>

<main>

<!-- Hero -->

<section class="about-hero">

<div class="container">

<p class="eyebrow">
ABOUT QUICK CHAN
</p>

<h1>

Helping International Buyers
Build Better Supply Chains.

</h1>

<p class="about-intro">

I'm Quick Chan, an MCIPS qualified procurement professional with more than 15 years of experience in international trade, procurement and supply chain management.

Through HYWSource, I help international companies source more confidently across Mainland China, Taiwan and Vietnam by combining structured procurement methodology with practical manufacturing knowledge.

</p>

</div>

</section>



<!-- About -->

<section class="section">

<div class="container">

<p class="eyebrow">
WHO I AM
</p>

<h2 class="section-title">

Procurement Expertise Backed by Real Manufacturing Experience

</h2>



<div class="about-grid">

<div class="about-photo">

<img
src="/images/quick-chan-canton-fair.jpg"
alt="Quick Chan at an international trade exhibition"
/>

</div>



<div class="about-content">

<p>

Many sourcing companies simply introduce factories.

My work begins much earlier — understanding your product, evaluating manufacturing capability, identifying commercial risks and helping buyers make better procurement decisions.

</p>

<p>

Over the past 15+ years I've worked with manufacturers across Mainland China, Taiwan and Vietnam covering home decoration, building materials, furniture, packaging, consumer products and industrial sourcing.

</p>

<p>

As an MCIPS qualified procurement professional, I apply internationally recognised procurement methodologies to supplier evaluation, purchasing strategy, supplier development and supply chain optimisation.

</p>

<p>

Rather than focusing only on unit price, I believe successful sourcing comes from balancing supplier capability, quality, delivery performance, communication and long-term business value.

</p>



<div class="about-tags">

<span>15+ Years Experience</span>

<span>MCIPS Qualified</span>

<span>Mainland China</span>

<span>Taiwan</span>

<span>Vietnam</span>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>



  <!-- Procurement Approach -->
  <section class="section light">

    <div class="container">

      <h2 class="section-title">
        A Procurement-Led Approach
      </h2>


      <p class="section-intro">
        Successful supply chains require more than finding suppliers.
        They require a structured procurement approach that balances cost,
        quality, capability and long-term reliability.
      </p>


        <div class="approach-grid">

        <div class="card">

          <h3>
            Supplier Evaluation
          </h3>

          <p>
            Assess supplier capability, production capacity, quality standards
            and suitability before establishing long-term partnerships.
          </p>

        </div>



        <div class="card">

          <h3>
            Purchasing Strategy
          </h3>

          <p>
            Support better purchasing decisions through market analysis,
            supplier comparison, negotiation and total cost consideration.
          </p>

        </div>



        <div class="card">

          <h3>
            Supply Chain Risk Management
          </h3>

          <p>
            Identify potential supply chain risks and develop practical
            solutions to improve resilience and continuity.
          </p>

        </div>



        <div class="card">

          <h3>
            Supplier Relationship Management
          </h3>

          <p>
            Build effective communication between buyers and manufacturing
            partners to support sustainable cooperation.
          </p>

        </div>


      </div>


    </div>

  </section>




    <!-- Professional Background -->
  <section class="section background-section">

    <div class="container">

      <p class="eyebrow">
        PROFESSIONAL BACKGROUND
      </p>

      <h2 class="section-title">
        Experience built through real manufacturing projects.
      </h2>

      <div class="stats-grid">

        <div class="stat-card">

          <h3>15+</h3>

          <span>Years in International Trade & Procurement</span>

          <p>
            Supporting overseas buyers with sourcing, supplier management and
            manufacturing coordination.
          </p>

        </div>

        <div class="stat-card">

          <h3>MCIPS</h3>

          <span>Chartered Procurement Qualification</span>

          <p>
            Applying internationally recognised procurement principles to
            sourcing, supplier evaluation and purchasing decisions.
          </p>

        </div>

        <div class="stat-card">

          <h3>Asia</h3>

          <span>Manufacturing Network</span>

          <p>
            Extensive supplier resources across Mainland China, Taiwan and
            Vietnam covering multiple consumer product categories.
          </p>

        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </section>




  <!-- Why Businesses Work With HYWSource -->

  <section class="section light">

    <div class="container">

      <p class="eyebrow">
        WHY HYWSOURCE
      </p>

      <h2 class="section-title">
        More than supplier sourcing.
      </h2>

      <p class="section-intro">
        Every sourcing project is managed from a procurement perspective—
        balancing quality, cost, lead time and long-term supplier capability.
      </p>

      <div class="card-grid">

        <div class="card">

          <h3>
            Procurement Thinking
          </h3>

          <p>
            Every recommendation considers commercial objectives, total cost,
            quality and long-term supply chain sustainability.
          </p>

        </div>

        <div class="card">

          <h3>
            Manufacturing Knowledge
          </h3>

          <p>
            Factory visits and production experience help bridge the gap
            between buyers and manufacturers.
          </p>

        </div>

        <div class="card">

          <h3>
            Practical Execution
          </h3>

          <p>
            From supplier selection through production follow-up and shipment,
            projects remain transparent and structured.
          </p>

        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </section>




  <!-- Why HYWSource -->
<section class="section">

  <div class="container">

    <h2 class="section-title">
      Why Businesses Work With HYWSource
    </h2>


    <div class="card-grid">


<div class="card">

<h3>
Procurement Perspective
</h3>

<p>
Procurement decisions based on cost, quality, supplier capability and long-term business objectives — not simply price.
</p>

</div>



<div class="card">

<h3>
Manufacturing Understanding
</h3>

<p>
Practical understanding of Asian manufacturing capabilities, production processes, materials and supplier evaluation.
</p>

</div>



<div class="card">

<h3>
Global Buyer Experience
</h3>

<p>
Experience supporting international buyers with supplier development, purchasing coordination and supply chain management.
</p>

</div>


</div>


  </div>

</section>




  <!-- CTA -->

<section class="section">

<div class="container">

<div class="dark-section">

<p class="eyebrow">
LET'S WORK TOGETHER
</p>

<h2>

Looking for a reliable procurement partner in Asia?

</h2>

<p>

Whether you're searching for new suppliers, evaluating existing manufacturers or improving your procurement process, I'd be happy to discuss your sourcing project.

</p>

<a
href="/contact"
class="btn-white"
>

Start a Conversation →

</a>

</div>

</div>

</section>

</main>
<style>

.about-grid{

display:grid;
grid-template-columns:420px 1fr;
gap:70px;
align-items:center;
margin-top:45px;

}

.about-photo img{

width:100%;
display:block;

border-radius:22px;

box-shadow:
0 18px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.12);

}

.about-content p{

margin-bottom:22px;
line-height:1.9;

}

.about-tags{

display:flex;
flex-wrap:wrap;
gap:14px;
margin-top:35px;

}

.about-tags span{

padding:10px 18px;

border:1px solid #ddd;

border-radius:999px;

background:#fafafa;

font-size:14px;

font-weight:600;

}



.stats-grid{

display:grid;

grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);

gap:30px;

margin-top:45px;

}



.stat-card{

background:#fff;

padding:36px;

border-radius:18px;

border:1px solid #e8e8e8;

transition:.25s;

}



.stat-card:hover{

transform:translateY(-4px);

box-shadow:0 16px 45px rgba(0,0,0,.08);

}



.stat-card h3{

font-size:52px;

margin-bottom:10px;

}



.stat-card span{

display:block;

font-weight:600;

margin-bottom:18px;

}



@media(max-width:900px){

.about-grid{

grid-template-columns:1fr;

gap:40px;

}

.stats-grid{

grid-template-columns:1fr;

}

}

</style>
</Layout>